    "text": "The proposed model and algorithm for debiasing the LLM evalua- tions, known as bipartite evaluation, can be applied in any scenario where pointwise evaluations are performed on a set of objects and varying biases exist across different evaluations. More broadly, the approach is applicable to any problem that can be framed as a peer-review (peer-grading) process.",
    "citation_focus_text": ""
  }
}
